# Curated installed-system manifest for Calamares' pacstrap step.
# Keep this separate from profile/packages.x86_64: that file is the Live ISO,
# with its Live-session packages and an intentionally larger recovery/AI stack.
# Target uses the same official AniOS desktop/gaming/AI package set plus a real
# Arch base, firmware, GRUB, storage/encryption tools and dual-boot detection.
# AUR apps (including Calamares, yay, browsers and GUI AI bundles) are excluded.
